      "side": 1,
      "message": "Can you move this into accelgyro_icm426xx.c driver file? \n\nSuggested prototype:\n    bool icm_detected(const struct motion_sensor_t *s);\n\nThe function would only return true if the I2C read is successful, and the WHO_AM_I register has a valid value.  Note that icm426xx_init() checks for two separate chip IDs.\n\nThis should be done as a separate changelist.\n\nThe new routine should be used by icm426xx_init() and by board_detect_motionsensor() in the lazor board file.\n\nThe code here then becomes much clearer:\n\n    if (icm_detected(\u0026icm426xx_base_accel))\n        motion_sensors[BASE_ACCEL] \u003d icm426xx_base_accel;\n        motion_sensors[BASE_GYRO] \u003d icm426xx_base_gyro;\n        base_accelgyro_config \u003d BASE_GYRO_ICM426XX;\n    else\n        base_accelgyro_config \u003d BASE_GYRO_BMI160;",
